title: "Processed Geospatial Datasets for Marine Spatial Planning in Tanzania (Deliverable 3: Ecological Assessment and Human-Use Map)"
abstract: "Harmonized, quality-controlled, and analysis-ready geospatial baseline datasets compiled for Marine Spatial Planning in the United Republic of Tanzania, covering maritime boundaries, ecological habitats, fisheries, and socioeconomic uses."
